&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Driving the plug-in power behind Unreal Engine 5. We bridge connections for licensees and our own internal game teams to online services. This allows games like Fortnite to utilize a combination of platform online services as well as Epic’s own online services to build cross-platform online features. Login, parties, voice chat, matchmaking, purchasing, cloud storage, and analytics are just a few examples of online features that our Online Game Services team helps games utilize.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;FRONTEND PROGRAMMER INTERN&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Social Web team builds the interfaces players use to connect with other players across Epic&#39;s ecosystem, including Fortnite, Rocket League, and Fall Guys. As an intern on the team, you&#39;ll ship real features that touch millions of players, gaining hands-on experience with production web development while being mentored through the full lifecycle of a feature, from design to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship features using React, JavaScript, and TypeScript, working directly in our production codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Partner with senior engineers to design and implement UI components and user flows for the social overlay experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Debug issues and contribute fixes across the front end, with guidance from your team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Participate in code reviews, both giving and receiving feedback, to build strong engineering habits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Take ownership of a well-scoped project or feature over the course of your internship, from planning through to shipping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Currently pursuing a degree in Computer Science or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Coursework or project experience with JavaScript and/or TypeScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Familiarity with React or another modern front-end framework&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;A strong interest in distributed systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
