&lt;li&gt;Work closely with art and design leads to ensure gameplay mechanics meet functional requirements and uphold our high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with other programming disciplines to integrate systems in support of the player experience&lt;/li&gt;
