&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with technical animators, Leads, Directors, and Outsource Managers on the team to ensure assets are set up for success in the different stages of production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and drive alignment around strategy for technical animation and adjacent cosmetics teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with production to schedule, prioritize, and delegate assets for the team, both internal and vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with animators, modelers, and designers to ensure a smooth development pipeline that delivers high-quality assets&lt;/li&gt;
