&lt;li&gt;Mentor rigging-focused technical animators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigging characters, weapons, creatures, and vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting up assets in Unreal Engine 5; including control rigs, cloth, physics, and blueprints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain detailed documentation, video reference, and examples of art asset production, procedures, and engine requirements to support internal and external artists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
