&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience rigging characters in Maya and/or Unreal Engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating rigging for a range of characters, bipeds, and creatures, both body and faces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to aesthetic detail, especially with regard to character deformation and physics movement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Unreal Engine 5 art pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive individual with strong written communication and teamwork skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control Rig experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python programming is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re user-focused, passionate, solutions-focused, and innovative. These traits equal success at Epic and influence everything we do&lt;/li&gt;
