&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a team of SDETs building automated test coverage across Unreal Engine, as well as mentor and coach SDETS at every career stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Write and ship production code in the team&#39;s test frameworks, tools, and CI integrations, as well as own the team&#39;s systems end to end, including design, reliability, and maintenance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Set the team&#39;s test roadmap, from unit and API coverage through input-driven end-to-end tests of the editor and runtime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Extend existing frameworks, including low-level, integration, and end to end tests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Turn manual test cases into automated coverage, as well as keep committed tests deterministic and reproducible on any machine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Leverage Al-assisted tools to speed up tool/framework development, test authoring, failure triage, and flake analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Increase visibility into test coverage and Cl health for engineering leadership, and influence the vision for the wider SDET organization at Epic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience leading software engineering teams, including mentorship, technical roadmaps, trade-offs, and prioritization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;A track record of writing and shipping production code while leading a team, as well as current, hands-on proficiency in C++ and at least one of C#, Python, or TypeScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strong knowledge of how game engines work. Unreal Engine 5 experience is preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience with automation frameworks and continuous integration at scale, and experience setting test strategy across unit, integration, and end-to-end levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience using AI coding tools in engineering work, and judgment about when their output can be trusted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ability to learn complex tech stacks quickly and extend existing investments rather than bypass them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Clear written communication with engineers, producers, and leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open to multiple locations across the US (including WA). &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
