&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the UI tech codebase used to build tools and in-game UI in Unreal Engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for UI tooling and mentor other programmers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across disciplines to identify improvement areas, gather feedback, and design solutions for developer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profile and resolve performance and memory issues in UI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Epic&#39;s internal teams and Unreal Engine licensees to help them solve UI challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
