&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the greater UXUI Department to ensure consistency and quality are maintained across the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute at a high-quality bar, work autonomously, and tackle complex features and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in Photoshop, Illustrator, and/or Figma to create concept UI art&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
